/-!
# Positive seed recoveries for rows 0 through 15

Each finite check proves membership in the published seed generators and
the two literal recovery identities. The shared order catalogue then supplies
an actual order-thirteen member of each selected extension. Sparse masks
certify that every product case in these rows is covered.

Source: Parrott (1972), section 5, p.683; `source/README.md`.
-/

